### Get All Room Bookings
GET http://localhost:5000/api/RoomBooking
###

### Get Room Booking by ID
GET http://localhost:5000/api/RoomBooking/1
###

### Create Room Booking
POST http://localhost:5000/api/RoomBooking
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "RoomId": 101,
    "UserId": "1",
    "BookingDate": "2025-12-20",
    "StartTime": "09:00:00",
    "EndTime": "10:00:00",
    "Purpose": "Team Meeting"
}
###

### Edit Room Booking
### Only RoomId, BookingDate, StartTime, EndTime, and Purpose can be updated
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/RoomBooking
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "Id": 1,
    "RoomId": 102,
    "UserId": "1",
    "BookingDate": "2025-12-21",
    "StartTime": "10:00:00",
    "EndTime": "11:00:00",
    "Purpose": "Project Discussion"
}
###

### Edit Room Booking with invalid data
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/RoomBooking
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "Id": 1,
    "RoomId": 0,
    "UserId": "1",
    "BookingDate": "invalid-date",
    "StartTime": "10:00:00",
    "EndTime": "09:00:00",
    "Purpose": ""
}
###

### Delete Room Booking
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/RoomBooking/1
###

### Get Bookings by User ID
GET http://localhost:5000/api/RoomBooking/user/1
###
